# Playwright Test Authoring

Canonical source: `.agents/shared/playwright-test-authoring.md`. Read it for the full procedure. Conventions: `.agents/shared/openproject-e2e.md`.

Load-bearing (even if you skip the full shared read):

- Default CLI + playwright-cli skill; MCP only with a named stockout.
- Exclusive claim: do not run CLI and MCP in parallel on the same page.
- Land selectors in `e2e/locators/*.json` → page objects via `getLocator` — never raw `page.*` in specs.
- Cap ≤3 fix loops total across both tools.
- Before finish, self-grep: forbid raw `page.getBy*` / `page.locator` in `e2e/tests/`, and any `pages/` paths.
- Full routing + failure stories: `.agents/shared/playwright-test-authoring.md`.
